#require "ontology.eflint".

Fact legal-basis Identified by
  subject * controller * purpose * data
  Holds when consent() && subject-of()

Fact consent Identified by 
  subject * controller * purpose

Act give-consent
  Actor subject
  Recipient controller
  Related to purpose
  Creates consent()
  Holds when !consent()

Act collect-personal-data
  Actor controller
  Recipient subject
  Related to data, processor, purpose 
  Creates processes()
  Conditioned by legal-basis() 
  Conditioned by accurate-for-purpose()
  Holds when subject-of()
